msgid "Instruments"
msgstr "效能分析工具"

msgid ""
"Please see the :ref:`sampling profiler instructions "
"<doc_sampling_profilers>` and the :ref:`tracing profiler instructions "
"<doc_tracing_profilers>` for more information."
msgstr ""
"如需瞭解更多資訊，請查閱 :ref:`sampling profiler instructions "
"<doc_sampling_profilers>` 和 :ref:`tracing profiler instructions "
"<doc_tracing_profilers>`。"

msgid ""
"Open `Xcode <https://developer.apple.com/xcode/>`__. Select **Open Developer "
"Tool** - **Instruments** from the **Xcode** app menu:"
msgstr ""
"打開 `Xcode <https://developer.apple.com/xcode/>`__。在頂部選單欄的 "
"**Xcode** 應用選單中，依次選擇 **Open Developer Tool** - **Instruments** ："

msgid "Double-click on **Time Profiler** in the **Instruments** window:"
msgstr "在 **Instruments** 視窗中雙擊 **Time Profiler**："

msgid ""
"In the Time Profiler window, click on the **Target** menu, select **Choose "
"target...** and specify the path to the Godot binary, command line "
"arguments, and environment variables in the next window."
msgstr ""
"在‘時間分析器（Time Profiler）’視窗中，點擊 **Target** （目標） 選單，選擇 "
"**Choose target...** （選擇目標...），然後在彈出的新視窗中指定 Godot 程式的路"
"徑、命令行參數以及環境變數。"

msgid ""
"You can also attach the Time Profiler to a running process by selecting it "
"from the **Target** menu."
msgstr "你也可以從 **Target** 選單將 Time Profiler 附加到正在執行的程序。"

msgid ""
"Click the **Start an immediate mode recording** button to start profiling."
msgstr "點選 **Start an immediate mode recording** 按鈕開始效能分析。"

msgid ""
"Perform the actions you wish to profile in the editor or project. When "
"you're done, click the **Stop** button."
msgstr "在編輯器或專案中執行要分析的操作，完成後點選 **Stop** 按鈕。"

msgid "Wait for the results to appear."
msgstr "等待結果顯示。"

msgid ""
"At the bottom of the window you will see a call tree for all CPU threads "
"started, and the **Heaviest Stack Trace** overview."
msgstr ""
"在視窗底部會看到所有已啟動 CPU 執行緒的呼叫樹，以及 **Heaviest Stack Trace** "
"概覽。"

msgid ""
"Select **Hide system libraries** in the **Call Tree** menu (at the bottom of "
"the window) to remove external modules."
msgstr ""
"在（視窗底部的） **呼叫樹** （Call Tree）選單中，勾選 **隱藏系統庫** （Hide "
"system libraries），以移除外部模組。"

msgid ""
"You can use the timeline at the top of the window to display details for the "
"specific time period."
msgstr "你可以利用視窗上方的時間軸，檢視特定時間區間的詳細資訊。"
